WEBVTT

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:33.600
with the most inhumane
conditions you can imagine.

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:38.720
And we were threatened by the jailers

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:44.120
with drinking water
that came from toilets.

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:51.080
We were finally released on the sixth day,

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:57.096
without any knowledge,
without any forewarning.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:59.896
Just out of the clear blue sky,

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.360
we were made to leave.